# Build context is the repository root (`docker build -f app/Dockerfile .`). Keep the context to
# what the Dockerfile actually COPYs.
# Patterns without `**` match at the root only, so `app/priv/docs/agent.md` (served at runtime) stays in.
.git
.github
**/.claude
**/.omc
**/.DS_Store

# Not part of the image
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE

# Build output, dependencies, crash dumps, secrets
**/_build
**/deps
**/doc
**/node_modules
**/erl_crash.dump
**/.elixir_ls
**/.lexical
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
app/priv/static/assets
app/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
app/priv/plts
